# ── Private quiz bank (Stage 16 defense-in-depth) ────────────────────────
# Stage 14/15 removed the client-side quiz bank; PostgreSQL (via the backend)
# is the sole authoritative source. Nothing has a legitimate reason to live
# under this path again, under ANY filename — ignored here (mirroring backend/
# .gitignore's equivalent rule) so a locally re-created copy is never
# accidentally staged/committed. The real enforcement is
# scripts/verify-no-bank-in-artifact.js, which checks the BUILT ARTIFACT
# regardless of what git tracks (a renamed file would still ignore just as
# well, but its content would still be caught there); this is a second,
# earlier layer that stops the file from being committed in the first place.
src/assets/data/

# Throwaway SQLite databases created per Playwright run (see
# e2e/support/e2e-database.ts). Deleted on teardown; anything left here is
# from an interrupted run and is swept at the next startup.
.e2e-db/
